    "type": "question",
    "label": "15",
    "prompt": "A student has an average mark of 68 from 10 tests. What mark must be gained in the next test to raise his average to 70?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "90 marks.",
      "worked": "Let $x$ be the mark in the next test. The first ten tests have a total of $10\\times68=680$ marks.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{680+x}{11}&=70\\\\680+x&=770\\\\x&=90\\end{align*}$$\nThe student must gain 90 marks.",
